From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:35:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] admin: every S17 section behind server-checked ADMIN_EMAILS
 wrappers

Team-only wrappers in convex/admin/ around each stream's internal admin
functions: the allow-list queue (Mark added, app capacity, add an app),
events (imports, published, rejected, and missing events; pull, restore,
feature, edit a price, find events now), matching (run now and the
inspector with similarity, shared items and their rarity weights), and
demo controls (seed, reset, demo clock, act as). Every wrapper is
annotated with the internal function's own return type to avoid a
circular type through the generated api. A test checks that each one
refuses a student who isn't on the team list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
